{"title":"Brask the Mole","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Brask the Mole is a named <a href=\"#/monster/brigand\">Brigand</a> seen at level 18.</p>\n      <h2>Wearing</h2><p></p><div class=\"gear-line\"><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>head</i> Feathered Cap Green</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>torso</i> Silver Torso</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>arms</i> Iron Arms</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>legs</i> Silver Legs</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>feet</i> Iron Feet</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>main hand</i> Silver Dagger</span></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find Brask the Mole</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>Bandit Hole</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 2×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-93\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"brask-the-mole\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"feathered-cap-green\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/79007a374862508e9d7f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Feathered Cap Green</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-spear\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b463ce049563b7e0bed6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Spear</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/219b427558814faec045.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Brask the Mole</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/brigand\">Brigand</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>18</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>171</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>3 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside